  "item_short_desc": "<p>&nbsp;Rothco's Hooded Reflective Rain Parka is the ultimate jacket in rain protection and safety. Constructed with 2-inch reflective striping around the chest, biceps, harness, lower waist, cuffs, and over the shoulders, this rain jacket ensures high visibility in low-light conditions. The storm/snap front provides full protection against the elements, while the pass-through pocket for audio devices and a five-button design adds convenience and functionality.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "145",
  "description": "<p>&nbsp;Rothco's Hooded Reflective Rain Parka is the ultimate jacket in rain protection and safety. Constructed with 2-inch reflective striping around the chest, biceps, harness, lower waist, cuffs, and over the shoulders, this rain jacket ensures high visibility in low-light conditions. The storm/snap front provides full protection against the elements, while the pass-through pocket for audio devices and a five-button design adds convenience and functionality. Additionally, the parka features a plastic zipper, a badge tab for easy identification, and a removable hood for versatility. Whether you're working outdoors, commuting, or engaging in any activity that requires weather protection and visibility, Rothco's Hooded Reflective Rain Coat is designed to keep you dry and safe.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
